  "statement": "As the TrustworthinessAgent, my requirements focus on ensuring data protection and secure access for users. TRU-01 ensures that only authenticated members can access borrowing features, promoting security. TRU-02 and TRU-03 enforce auditability and the protection of personal data, vital for user trust. TRU-04 implements role-based access control, ensuring that only authorized personnel manage sensitive information. TRU-05 provides secure management of overdue books. TRU-06 enables members to manage their data securely, and TRU-07 promotes strong password policies to protect user accounts.",
